Why this works

Each section has a different communication role:

Section	Operator
Remember Who You Are	Identity
Rewild Your Day	Story
What’s Inside	Information
Mission Brief	Coordination
Hawg Code	Ritual
Choose Hard	Inspiration
Challenge Coin	Game
Boar Facts	Curiosity/Education
Our Promise	Trust
Join the Sounder	Community

Instead of trying to make the customer think “this is an energy gummy,” the bag quietly tells a richer story:

You’re the kind of person who chooses action, keeps promises, helps the crew, and builds momentum.

The gummies become the physical product. The packaging becomes the interface to the brand.

I think that’s consistent with the direction you’ve been taking Wild Hawg: not selling caffeine alone, but creating a recognizable culture around “Remember Who You Are” and “Rewild Your Day.”